<!-- Status bar icon for the Live Update notification.

     A notification small icon is drawn as a MASK: Android keeps the alpha and
     throws the colour away, so this is white on transparent and nothing else.
     Give it a colour and it still renders white, give it a background and the
     background becomes a white block. That is why this is not the launcher
     icon shrunk down.

     The mark is Meridian's meridian line: a circle crossed by a vertical. -->
